{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fusion of classic RPG and deckbuilding, where epic adventures meet strategic card battles. Ascend the Tower of Legends, build your own deck, confront fearsome monsters, and forge your own destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/e860f12dc1d7f031b92b1f25bba098a3.poster.avif?t=1751281912\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/e860f12dc1d7f031b92b1f25bba098a3.apng?t=1751281912\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=32 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIFE IN THE CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/cbbabf133cd3bb55a0df2bce0878e529.poster.avif?t=1751281912\" width=618 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/cbbabf133cd3bb55a0df2bce0878e529.webm?t=1751281912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/8bacd49cb90dcbea980597562a1ec7d3.poster.avif?t=1751281912\" width=618 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/8bacd49cb90dcbea980597562a1ec7d3.webm?t=1751281912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health is a valuable resource in this game. Every card played exacts a toll on your health points, making every decision a high-stakes gamble. Choose your moves wisely, as you must balance power with preservation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE DECK BUILDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/a6d946f722cfd90eea3003374ac9bb43.poster.avif?t=1751281912\" width=618 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/a6d946f722cfd90eea3003374ac9bb43.webm?t=1751281912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a vast array of cards during your journey, each with its own set of abilities and consequences. Your deck evolves as you progress, reflecting your character's growth and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALTER THE RULES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/484b8324d3d9ddd8a8be4ea52d1b1ee7.poster.avif?t=1751281912\" width=618 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/484b8324d3d9ddd8a8be4ea52d1b1ee7.webm?t=1751281912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use world cards to change the rules of the game and raid the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VARIABLE DIFFICULTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/516679d40d6271e2a52e7d2069215d69.poster.avif?t=1751281912\" width=618 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/516679d40d6271e2a52e7d2069215d69.webm?t=1751281912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensures that the game can be played by newcomers and veterans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROCEDURALLY GENERATED FLOORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for an ever-changing challenge. Each floor of the Tower is procedurally generated, ensuring that no two runs are the same. Unearth hidden secrets, discover new strategies, and face unforeseen obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FRESH ART STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel art implemented in a 3D world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/e860f12dc1d7f031b92b1f25bba098a3.poster.avif?t=1751281912\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://sha